    "%lld個のプロファイルは、この版の Nonet では読めない中身（新しい版で加わった種類のマスなど）があったため、その部分を読み込めませんでした。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld profile had content this version of Nonet can't read (such as button types added in a newer version), so those parts weren't imported."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld profiles had content this version of Nonet can't read (such as button types added in a newer version), so those parts weren't imported."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
