    },
    "今のプロファイルと設定は、この控えの中身に置き換わります。今の設定も「以前の設定に戻す」に残すので、後で戻せます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your current profiles and settings are replaced with this version. The current settings are also saved in Restore an Earlier Version, so you can go back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今のマスはすべて、プリセットの中身に置き換わります。⌘Z で元に戻せます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All current buttons are replaced with the preset. You can undo this with ⌘Z."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今の設定を控えに残せなかったので、戻しませんでした。ディスクの空きと、設定のフォルダに書き込めるかを確かめてください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your current settings couldn't be kept as a backup, so nothing was restored. Check that the disk has free space and that the settings folder can be written to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
